/-! ## Constants and tables the generator could not turn into a definition -/

/-
Macros of the headers that are not emitted as a constant: 32 names, by reason.
  empty: a feature flag:
    DEFLATE_H FAR GUNZIP HAVE_MEMCPY HAVE_VSNPRINTF STDC
    STDC99 ZCONF_H ZEXPORT ZEXPORTVA ZLIB_H ZLIB_INTERNAL
    ZUTIL_H Z_HAVE_UNISTD_H Z_LARGE64 Z_LFS64 z_const
  not an integer constant expression:
    Code Dad Freq Len ZEXTERN Z_U4
    Z_U8 local max_insert_length z_off64_t z_off_t zlib_version
    zmemcmp zmemcpy
  uses sizeof, which the evaluator does not know:
    GZ_OFF_MAX

Names that are also an enumerator: `COPY` is emitted as `GZ_COPY`.
`GZ_OFF_MAX` (gzguts.h) is `((((z_off64_t)1 << (sizeof(z_off64_t) * CHAR_BIT - 2)) - 1) * 2 + 1)`, that is
9223372036854775807 here; it is defined with that value in the translation of gzguts.h.
-/

